    <string name="menu_about">About</string>
    <string name="about_message">VaxiCov %1$s\n\nFinds bookable vaccination slots by pincode or district and alerts you in the background when new ones open up.\n\nThe data source is pluggable: the bundled sample data lets the app run without any backend, and a new registry can be added by implementing one SlotProvider.\n\nBuilt by Akshay Chavan and Jayesh Suryavanshi.</string>
